      vs MESSENGER |Gdot/G| < 4e-14/yr (Genova+18)      -> EXCEEDED x   246
      vs LLR Gdot/G 2sig 2.42e-14/yr (Biskupek+21)     -> EXCEEDED x   407
      lunar drift 3.79 mm/yr vs LLR tidal budget +-0.08 mm/yr -> 47 sigma
      Saturn 14.1 m/yr vs Cassini-era proxy ~2.3 m/yr -> x6;  Mars 2.25 m/yr vs proxy ~0.05 m/yr -> x45
   alt rho_tot cH0: |rdot|/r = a0/c = 3.769e-19 /s = 1.189e-11 /yr
